# tof_silent_est_high_noise.scn — the hover-thrust estimate 35 % too high (noise n2) overshoots the 1.2 m ceiling in the auto-takeoff
#                                  ホバー推力の見積もりが（ノイズ n2 で）35 % 高く、自動離陸が天井 1.2 m を行き過ぎる
#
# tof_silent_est_high.scn with the sensor-noise model n2 (`--noise n2`; the plant's true hover thrust is 0.30 N there, so the estimate 0.406 N is
# 1.35 x the truth). The auto-takeoff reaches 1.5 m/s at the ToF handoff and the altitude loop's thrust bottoms at 0.89 x the weight,
# so the craft went on to 1.68 m (the ceiling is 1.2 m, the ToF's range 1.6 m: the ToF then became invalid and LANDING started in the air). The altitude
# ceiling is now effective (2026-11-09): above kAltitudeCeilingM + kAltitudeCeilingMarginM (1.35 m) no climb command is
# allowed and, while the craft is still rising, the thrust is at most 0.5 x the estimate. Spec under test:
#  1. The truth peak stays below 1.55 m over the whole run (before: 1.69 m; with the noise off the same scenario stays at 1.2 m).
#  2. The craft comes down to the floor by the descent without a ToF (silence at 15.6 s) and the motors stop only there; no time-limit end, no emergency DISARM.
#  3. ARM is refused while the sensor is silent.
#
# tof_silent_est_high.scn をセンサノイズモデル n2（`--noise n2`。そこではプラントの真のホバー推力は 0.30 N で、見積もり 0.406 N は
# 真値の 1.35 倍）で行う。自動離陸は ToF の引き継ぎで 1.5 m/s に達し、高度ループの推力は重さの 0.89 倍で底を打つので、機体は
# 1.68 m まで行った（天井は 1.2 m、ToF の有効距離 1.6 m: ToF が無効になり、空中で LANDING が始まった）。高度の天井は今は実効的
# （2026-11-09）: kAltitudeCeilingM + kAltitudeCeilingMarginM（1.35 m）を超えたら上昇の指令を一切許さず、
# まだ上昇中の間は推力を見積もりの 0.5 倍以下にする。検証する仕様:
#  1. 真値の最高は走行全体で 1.55 m 未満（以前: 1.69 m。ノイズなしの同じシナリオは 1.2 m）。
#  2. 機体は ToF なしの降下（15.6 s の出力停止）で床まで降り、モータは床の上でだけ止まる。時間切れ・非常の DISARM では終わらない。
#  3. センサが出力停止している間、ARM は拒否される。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/tof_silent_est_high_noise.scn --target vehicle --duration 28000000 --noise n2
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    param      hover.thrust.learn 0                                                # stop the hover-thrust learning, so the wrong estimate stays wrong
   +    param      hover.thrust_corr 1.12                                              # estimate 1.12 x mg = 0.406 N against the true hover 0.34 N (+19 %; the loop settles on 0.34)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD (7.5 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     4500      50        1              # D: auto-takeoff, hold 0.5 m (to 13.0 s)
   +    rc         4095  2048   2048    2048  1     2600      50        1              # E: stick up 2.6 s — climbing past 1.5 m (13.0-15.6 s)
   +    tof_silent 1                                                                   # F: 15.6 s — ToF output stops while still rising (1.55 m, 0.57 m/s)
   +    rc         4095  2048   2048    2048  1     400       50        1              # G: the pilot keeps the stick up
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     9000      50        1              # H: LANDING by silence (~15.9 s), blind descent, touchdown ~19.4 s (to 25.0 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50        1              # I: release the ARM button
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # J: press again (25.2 s) -> ARM REFUSED
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50        1              # K: settle
